# L §3.3 accrue: "Exact where the power is an integer; otherwise it needs to u": effective over 181/365 of a year
# (LOAD-TO).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input p: money PLN
input r: rate
input d1: date
input d2: date
def a: num PLN = accrue(p, r, d1, d2, act365, effective) at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  p = 1 000.00 PLN
  r = 12 %/year
  d1 = 2026-01-01
  d2 = 2026-07-01

ask q: a law 2026-06-30
=== expect
refused: LOAD-TO ...
